 "settings": {
  "osm_fallback": true,
  "host_delays": {
   "ert.gfp.sd.gov": 10
  },
  "about": "Nov 2 (PR 4): osm_fallback true (default, Brandon's rule) = when NO official line is found, kpc_state_trails.py may draw an OpenStreetMap line, always labelled 'Unofficial line (OpenStreetMap)'; an official line always wins and replaces it. false = OpenStreetMap is never searched (lines already saved stay, labelled, until an official one replaces them). Env KPC_OSM_TRAILS=1/0 overrides for one run. host_delays = seconds between two requests to that site (default 2 s, env POLITE); a site's robots.txt Crawl-delay is honoured too (the longest wait wins, at most 60 s)."
 },
